group=\"code:PSY 481\"  class=\"notoffered\">PSY 481</a>.</p><p class=\"cls\">Students with a term class standing of Freshman or Sophomore may <strong>not</strong> enroll.</p>", "corequisites": "", "department_approval_required": "", "recommendations": "Background work in family life or education", "fees": "", "attribute_description": "", "books_html": "", "clssnotes": "<p>Meets training requirements for the Registered Behavior\nTechnician (RBT) certification; offered independently of the\nBehavior Analyst Certification Board.\n<p><a href=\"http://oregonstate.edu/registrar/rtfiles/q.html?\n:&202701&PSY&485&001&11906\" target=\"blank\">Textbooks</a></p>", "meeting_html": "<div class=\"meet\">TR 10am-11:50am<span class=\"meet-room-202701\"> in <a href=\"https://map.oregonstate.edu/?id=2243#!m/1027609?share\" target=\"_blank\">CORD 1424 - Cordley Hall East 1424 (GP)</a></span><span class=\"meet-dates\"> (9/23 to 12/4)</span></div>", "exams_html": "", "instructordetail_html": "<div class=\"instructor-detail\">Corey Magnuson</div>", "all_sections": "<div class=\"course-sections\" role=\"grid\" aria-readonly=\"true\"><div role=\"row\"><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">CRN</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Section #</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Campus</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Meets</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Type</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Max Enrl</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Actual Enrl</div></div><a role=\"row\" href=\"#\" class=\"course-section\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:PSY 485\" data-srcdb=\"202701\" data-key=\"crn:11906\"><div role=\"rowheader\" class=\"course-section-crn\"><span class=\"header-text\">CRN: </span> 11906</div><div role=\"gridcell\" class=\"course-section-section\"><span class=\"header-text\">Section #: </span> 001</div><div role=\"gridcell\" class=\"course-section-camp\"><span class=\"header-text\">Campus: </span> Cor